# Frantic Firebolt also counts a card "that has an Adventure" (CR 715.1, 700.2): Charming Scoundrel's first mode discards Bonecrusher
# Giant (a creature card with the Adventure Stomp) and draws, so X is 2 + 1 = 3 and Bot2's Wall of Earth (0/6) is dealt exactly 3.
# The Black Lotus in the graveyard (no Adventure, an artifact) adds nothing. Charming Scoundrel itself, on the battlefield, is not in the
# graveyard. Black Lotus and two Mox Rubies pay for {1}{R} and {2}{R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Charming Scoundrel
Bonecrusher Giant
Frantic Firebolt
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Wall of Earth
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Earth.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Charming Scoundrel.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Bonecrusher Giant)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Bonecrusher Giant; Black Lotus
Bot1.Hand.Frantic Firebolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Earth)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Earth.Damage = 3
